{"4326770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Angel Devil Machine - Episode 1: The Princes and the Prototype", "steam_appid": 4326770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A n g e l   D e v i l   M a c h i n e</strong> <br>Episode ONE - The Princes and the Prototype</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 1930s Dieselpunk/Cyberpunk <u>third-person adventure game AND flight-combat shooter</u>... with Jet-powered Biplanes, Zeppelins, and a Mech Aircraft Carrier!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...You are cast into a massive world of Zeppelins, Biplanes, Sci-Fi Cyberpunk, and Magic. A parallel dimension is breaking through to our world - and with it comes a dark power that plans to subjugate the world of Human-kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is hope in the promise of brave and valiant human beings who will venture through this parallel dimension, unlock its mysteries, and stop the dark and powerful H.O.S.T. from devastating humanity and the multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU are that hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DARE to enter the world of Angel Devil Machine...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly your jet-powered biplane on a SECRET MISSION in this first episode of </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the Angel Devil Machine videogame series. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure in 1930s Deco Dieselpunk/Cyberpunk STYLE, with Jet-powered Biplanes, Zeppelins, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and a Mech Aircraft Carrier!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic short-play (20 min story playtime) - </strong><strong><u>a game you can afford the time to play through</u></strong><strong>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"b